WEBVTT

1
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,460
Teacher Jiang

2
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,960
You are making a speech

3
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:26,290
You can even speak by yourself

4
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:29,090
This bit of knowledge is not difficult for me

5
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:32,850
I did it all myself, Ms. Chen

6
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:36,650
Go back and tell Su Weiwei what I will do from tomorrow morning.

7
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:38,010
She has to get something in exchange

8
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:39,410
Teacher Jiang, you want to separate the family

9
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,320
We are not on the same journey

10
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,380
It was a shipwreck that threw us on this desert island

11
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:46,900
Why did we separate the family?

12
00:00:52,690 --> 00:00:53,730
I don't take advantage of anyone

13
00:00:54,290 --> 00:01:05,660
Don't take advantage of me. One speech and one hunt.

14
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:09,460
Everyone is looking for their own way out

15
00:01:10,730 --> 00:01:11,850
Where should I go?
